        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cdf78713-05e9-369f-9a2a-a2235e60f488",
                "word": "якобы",
                "pos": "conj",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27ddc006-87bf-3df9-974e-4cf8e44bd9e5",
                        "entry_id": "cdf78713-05e9-369f-9a2a-a2235e60f488",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. употребляется для присоединения придаточной части сложноподчинённого предложения и указывает на то, что эта часть содержит сообщение, которое говорящий не признаёт своим и за его достоверность не отвечает"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1354a58-637f-47a1-97bc-3b6a0f1cd15a",
                                "sense_id": "27ddc006-87bf-3df9-974e-4cf8e44bd9e5",
                                "text": "В нём было сказано, что о злодействующем с яицкой стороны́ носится слух, якобы он другого состояния, нежели как есть; но что он в са́мом деле донской казак Емельян Пугачёв, за прежние преступления наказанный кнутом с поставлением на лице знаков."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e7fed26-6e65-47db-a764-2c8221a08dc6",
                                "sense_id": "27ddc006-87bf-3df9-974e-4cf8e44bd9e5",
                                "text": "И этот же врач, ра́вно как и некоторые другие, разъезжает, ни копейки не тратя, но в разъездных отчётах проставляет за каждую версту двенадцать копеек, якобы он разъезжает на наёмных лошадях…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24073a12-8614-4efe-8889-cfdf2e644299",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdf78713-05e9-369f-9a2a-a2235e60f488",
                        "source_sense_id": "27ddc006-87bf-3df9-974e-4cf8e44bd9e5",
                        "target_lang_word": "allegedly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allegedly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ebd6e46-3652-3184-9401-48d6c2b0a239",
                                        "entry_id": "3f2cd755-53e9-3e5d-a861-18875c8bd756",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to someone's allegation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e20d5cb-c29a-4a70-957b-f953c68be164",
                                                "sense_id": "1ebd6e46-3652-3184-9401-48d6c2b0a239",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: reportedly, reputedly, purportedly, putatively, rumoredly, supposedly, ostensibly, possibly, probably, likely, plausibly"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b1a90e-97fc-4d4e-a427-9339207b66a3",
                                                "sense_id": "1ebd6e46-3652-3184-9401-48d6c2b0a239",
                                                "text": "The suspect was allegedly involved in the robbery, but his alibi placed him in another state at the time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de3af4a8-a58a-4d71-9f8d-67549f96507e",
                                                "sense_id": "1ebd6e46-3652-3184-9401-48d6c2b0a239",
                                                "text": "An ATV-riding Texan was a massive problem to Tesla owners when he allegedly rammed his 4-wheeler into multiple cars during an unprovoked hit-and-run spree on Tuesday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7510df5-ee5f-3e29-8b27-2957a00936fd",
                                        "entry_id": "3f2cd755-53e9-3e5d-a861-18875c8bd756",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to someone's conspicuous impressions (which could subsequently be alleged)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19774282-0a02-48d4-a3b6-069f17748c6e",
                                                "sense_id": "d7510df5-ee5f-3e29-8b27-2957a00936fd",
                                                "text": "The game is allegedly exciting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "014c49e0-1ef2-4795-891d-4cee07de977e",
                                                "sense_id": "d7510df5-ee5f-3e29-8b27-2957a00936fd",
                                                "text": "Philip Rivers is allegedly having the best season of any quarterback in the league."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b01b6d2-59a5-417a-9eca-d01560572120",
                                                "sense_id": "d7510df5-ee5f-3e29-8b27-2957a00936fd",
                                                "text": "...her onscreen tears are allegedly real."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab32caaa-d4c4-4943-bedd-c2b7719b7e7c",
                                                "sense_id": "d7510df5-ee5f-3e29-8b27-2957a00936fd",
                                                "text": "No doubt you’re tired of reading about his colourful escapades – about his glamorous home, his allegedly dodgy tenderpreneur deals, his gushing praise of malevolent dictators, or his soundly articulated international economic policy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
                    {
                        "linkage_id": "d504476a-b969-4ba1-857f-4f339ad26f35",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdf78713-05e9-369f-9a2a-a2235e60f488",
